key_findings:
NLS reliability needs explicit design:
- no notification-history API (only getActiveNotifications catch-up on reconnect);
- OEM background killing (dontkillmyapp ranks Huawei, Xiaomi, OnePlus, Samsung worst);
- no delivery during lockdown mode;
- private-space apps are stopped while the space is locked;
- user-editable per-app listener filters;
- duplicate sightings (bank app + SMS app; MessagingStyle re-carrying up to 25 past messages).
